1
00:00:00,038 --> 00:00:01,862
Eropa pernah percaya...

2
00:00:01,862 --> 00:00:05,397
pohon dari Jawa ini membunuh
burung yang terbang di dekatnya.

3
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:07,543
Namanya pohon upas.

4
00:00:07,543 --> 00:00:10,265
Narapidana dikirim mengambil getahnya...

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:12,058
hampir tak ada yang kembali.

6
00:00:12,058 --> 00:00:13,960
Ternyata itu dongeng...

7
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,699
getahnya memang racun sumpit,

8
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:17,628
tapi tak membunuh dari jauh.

9
00:00:17,628 --> 00:00:18,592
Anehnya,

10
00:00:18,592 --> 00:00:20,369
dongeng itu mendunia...

11
00:00:20,369 --> 00:00:23,913
sampai Uni Soviet menamai kapal
selam tercepat di dunia...

12
00:00:23,913 --> 00:00:24,792
Ancar,

13
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:26,229
nama Jawa pohon ini!

14
00:00:26,229 --> 00:00:27,136
Di daerahmu,

15
00:00:27,136 --> 00:00:28,384
pohon ini disebut apa?

16
00:00:28,384 --> 00:00:29,980
Tulis di komentar!
